## Runtime Requirements
# Python 3.13+
# Node.js 20+ (for Playwright tests only)
# YouTube Data API v3 key (set YT_API_KEY in .env)
# Optional: STORAGE_PROVIDER (r2/s3/local) for avatar uploads
# Optional: SMTP settings for password reset emails

## Quick Start
# 1. cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
# 2. Edit .env with your values (JWT_SECRET required)
# 3. pip install -r backend/requirements.txt
# 4. cd backend && alembic upgrade head
# 5. uvicorn main:app --reload
# 6. Open http://localhost:8000

